# --- Robot password store: never commit plaintext or private keys ---------------------------------
# The ENCRYPTED store (secrets/robot_passwords.age) and the PUBLIC recipient
# (secrets/recipient.txt) are meant to be committed. Everything below is the
# stuff that must never reach git: the shared private key and any decrypted
# copy of the store.
Automations_GUI/secrets/*.key
Automations_GUI/secrets/*.agekey
Automations_GUI/secrets/*age-secret*
Automations_GUI/secrets/identity*
Automations_GUI/*.age-identity
# Any plaintext / decrypted dump of the store.
Automations_GUI/secrets/*.plain.json
Automations_GUI/secrets/*.plaintext
Automations_GUI/secrets/*decrypted*

# Temporary one-off bootstrap that re-introduces cookie scraping to seed the store; delete after use.
Automations_GUI/password_collector.py


Automations_GUI/__pycache__
Automations_GUI/build
Automations_GUI/dist

Automations_GUI/Password_Management/__pycache__
Automations_GUI/Sheets_Automation/__pycache__